# Exception: the two artifacts config/pipeline.yaml currently pins, committed
# deliberately so a fresh clone (e.g. a free hosting deploy) can run
# pipeline.score / pipeline.topics without retraining - these load a pinned
# sha and never retrain by design, so without this exception a fresh clone
# would only have models/registry.json pointing at files that don't exist.
# Bump this exception by hand whenever the pin in config/pipeline.yaml
# changes (see docs/decisions.md) - it is never updated automatically.
